   "like_count": 3,
   "cooked": "<p>This is my template to send to people:</p>\n<p>If you want to get in:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Apply here: <a class=\"inline-onebox\" href=\"https://commonsstack.org/apply\">Apply</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>After we approve your application, Activate here: <a href=\"https://member.commonsstack.foundation/\">https://member.commonsstack.foundation/</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Then get some wxDai and send it here: <a href=\"https://hatch.tecommons.org/\">https://hatch.tecommons.org/</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>",
